&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Eucalyptus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on a mission to make good health last a lifetime. More than 1 billion people live with obesity worldwide, driving preventable chronic conditions. We&#39;re here to build better long-term care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is now part of Hims &amp;amp; Hers, the global leader in personalised health and wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is the company behind Juniper, one of the world&#39;s largest weight-management programs combining GLP-1 medication with personalised nutrition, movement support, and clinician-led care from prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists, and dietitians. Our published clinical research shows that our combined clinical and behavioural approach helps patients lose significantly more weight during their treatment with Juniper by four times.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Growth Story:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About the role (What You&#39;ll Do)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you&#39;ll own visual craft end-to-end; from shaping how a campaign idea comes to life in a pitch, to what it looks and feels like in market across paid social, YouTube, and beyond. Some days that means being on the tools yourself, and on others it means directing a shoot or guiding a team through a fast-turnaround sprint. The work spans quick social shoots at the Juniper office through to multi-month campaigns with celebrities, and everything in between. Working closely with the performance marketing team, the role is as much about what performs as what looks great — feeding creative data back into ideation and driving fast iterations across Juniper&#39;s weekly creative cycles. As the visual identity custodian for the growth team, this role is also the connective tissue between growth, product, web, and global brand, ensuring consistency across every touchpoint and acting as the growth team&#39;s key point of contact.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the visual craft of projects from concept to execution &amp;amp; live in market — spanning art direction, storyboarding, campaign identity, and social content, with a strong focus on paid social and campaign and YouTube.You&#39;ll be on the tools yourself or directing others, depending on the day and project, with work ranging from quick-turnaround social shoots in the Juniper office with staff or testimonial talent, to multi-month campaigns with celebrities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Respond to early-stage briefs by generating ideas and pitching them to senior stakeholders, to shape at a high level how our brand shows up to our market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Champion art and visual direction across pre-production and on set. You are responsible not only for the idea, but for how it is produced. Contribute to casting decisions and collaborate with external contractors (stylists, producers, HMUA, production designers, etc) to guide the team and deliver visuals that best answer the brief.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review creative performance data and contribute to weekly ideation sessions with the performance marketing team— bringing insights back into the work and being hands-on in making improvements &amp;amp; iterations happen within Juniper&#39;s fast weekly creative performance sprints.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide day-to-day output from paid social editing teams, while executing on simultaneous projects across larger campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and coach a small team of senior creatives specialising in post-production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As the most senior designer or art director in the growth team, act as custodian of Juniper&#39;s visual identity — building cross-functional relationships with designers across product, web, email, global teams, and the global creative director to share learnings, align on visual identities, and drive consistency across all brand touchpoints.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About You (Who you are)&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in advertising design, graphic design, art direction, or closely related creative roles; ideally with strong in-house experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in an Australian design or advertising agency, with a portfolio that demonstrates strong craft across ads, branding, and campaign identity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sharp visual eye with strengths in typography, layout, imagery, and building polished, premium brand expression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable being hands-on in the work, using design craft to respond to briefs and turn ideas into high-quality creative outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sydney-based and able to work closely with the team in person, including regular involvement in shoots and collaborative creative development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Empathetic &amp;amp; Culturally Aware&lt;/strong&gt;: You understand that Juniper operates in a sensitive category. Your creative choices reflect empathy, credibility, and respect for the audience&#39;s journey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Passionate About the Mission&lt;/strong&gt;: You genuinely care about women&#39;s health and want to help build a brand that supports women through every stage of their journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance-Minded&lt;/strong&gt;: You&#39;re comfortable working with performance data and using insights to improve your work. You understand that beautiful design should also drive results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work more efficiently, including within our recruitment process. These tools support our team — all hiring decisions are made by real people, and every application is reviewed by a member of our recruitment team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Eucalyptus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on a mission to make good health last a lifetime. More than 1 billion people live with obesity worldwide, driving preventable chronic conditions. We&#39;re here to build better long-term care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is now part of Hims &amp;amp; Hers, the global leader in personalised health and wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is the company behind Juniper, one of the world&#39;s largest weight-management programs combining GLP-1 medication with personalised nutrition, movement support, and clinician-led care from prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists, and dietitians. Our published clinical research shows that our combined clinical and behavioural approach helps patients lose significantly more weight during their treatment with Juniper by four times.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Growth Story:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;About the role&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Office of the CEO is the small team that exists to provide leverage to the CEO and leadership team, in whatever form that may take. Part analyst, part operator, part writer: an apprenticeship in how a 10-figure P&amp;amp;L division is actually run, sitting closer to the CEO and the core decisions than almost anyone at your level, anywhere.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll report to the CEO’s Chief of Staff to combine problem-solving with hands-on execution, working proactively with Growth, Product, Legal, Finance, and other areas of the business to turn strategy into reality.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The best CEO offices in the world do five things: run the leadership team&#39;s operating rhythm, speed decisions up, produce analysis that everyone trusts, take on the problems that don&#39;t have a home yet, and produce people who go on to run things. Some examples of what this involves:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Produce the operating weekly view of the business&lt;/strong&gt; that executives in the U.S., Europe and Australia run the company off - revenue, marketing spend and cohort economics across every market reconciled with the finance function of a listed company. You&#39;ll know where every figure comes from and defend any of them.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help run the operating rhythm of the leadership team&lt;/strong&gt; - the weekly business review, the executive leadership meeting, the monthly global all-hands, the quarterly offsites (the last two: London and New York). Agendas, packs, pre-reads, follow-ups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Help build the analysis behind the biggest calls we make&lt;/strong&gt; - group financial forecasts in conjunction with FP&amp;amp;A, repricing models with cohort analyses, stage-gate financial plans, a competitor&#39;s launch sized from external data, competitor tracking across different growth channels.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Write the words the company runs on&lt;/strong&gt; - the all-hands narrative, the notes flying between Sydney and New York, the write-up when something big changes. Synthesis is the job: compressing complicated materials into things multiple different groups (leaders, all staff, new joiners) can absorb in one pass.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Take the problems that have no home - &lt;/strong&gt;leading the change of rituals that the leadership partake in, rebuilding the system and execution of our Global Growth teams, integration workstreams, equity and payment models arising from the transaction with Hims &amp;amp; Hers where the tolerance for error is zero. They land in this team first. You run them until they&#39;re solved or until they&#39;ve become someone&#39;s full-time job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pitch your own mandate. The surface area is the whole company. Market and competitor intelligence. Deep dives on companies and new verticals nobody has had time for. New market and category scans. A pricing engine. AI tooling for how the executive team works. A faster way for our global teams to see the same numbers, different capital allocation rituals. You’ll be encouraged to run projects you pitch.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;One thing to know before you apply: &lt;/strong&gt;This is an intense role working with an intense set of stakeholders who are committed to winning. We also span several time zones: Sydney, London, New York, and California. Some calls land at ~7 AM in Australia while some finish at 11 PM. The trade is responsibility years ahead of your experience, and a rate of learning we think you’ll find incredibly rewarding.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why should you join Eucalyptus now?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The most rewarding careers come from being in the right place at the right time: The Facebook growth team in 2008, Uber while it was still in a few cities, Airbnb before the sharing economy. The pattern behind them is remarkably consistent: a truly global market, proven product-market fit, tailwinds driving double-digit monthly growth, and bottlenecks that are commercial rather than technical. The hard part is timing: after the model is proven but before the market has priced the upside.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;That&#39;s where we believe preventative healthcare is right now. GLP-1s are the defining pharmaceutical innovation of our generation, and they&#39;ve created an addressable market of more than 30% of the population of every country on earth. We&#39;re growing &amp;gt;10% month on month in markets that are less than 5% penetrated, and we&#39;ve watched markets go from launch to nine figures of ARR in under six months. In this role, you’ll be privy to the capital allocation decisions and have exposure to some of the best D2C operators in the world in a truly global category.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About You (Who We&#39;re Looking For)&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills and experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You have 2-3 years of experience working in a high-pressure environment&lt;/strong&gt; such as consulting (MBB preferred), investment banking, or as an operator in a recent high-growth startup. We&#39;re open to other backgrounds, but we operate at the intensity of these types of organisations and are uncompromising on our expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Judgement under ambiguity: &lt;/strong&gt;You can research a market or topic independently, work out what the unit economics depend on and the WYNTB (‘what you’d need to believe’), as well as landing on a clear, structured go/no-go point of view.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication and sharp writing: &lt;/strong&gt;You write tight theses and clear slide decks. A one-pager an executive can act on without needing a meeting; a tight, coherent thesis; a clean deck. Synthesis is the job.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial &amp;amp; financial modelling:&lt;/strong&gt; You can build a commercial model from scratch, make your assumptions explicit, and defend them across market sizing, unit economics&amp;nbsp; (CAC, LTV, payback), and deal structures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; Data: &lt;/strong&gt;You&#39;re comfortable getting your own answers from data and know how to make AI work for you. You&#39;re genuinely strong with Claude, not just prompting it for first drafts, but using it to automate access to information, stress-test arguments, and build repeatable workflows. You see it as leverage on your thinking, never a replacement for it. The ability to self-serve using Sigma will also be highly valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project management:&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ve run complex cross-functional workstreams with real accountability on tight deadlines.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Founder mindset: &lt;/strong&gt;You operate like a founder and enjoy the hustle of getting things done. You are an example of resilience and ownership - when something breaks, you fix it; you don&#39;t wait for others. You want to run something eventually and treat this as the apprenticeship for it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Behaviours &amp;amp; Attitudes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You act like an owner and lead with humility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re incredibly curious and enjoy stress testing your thinking and conclusions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are low ego and highly coachable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re resilient, adaptable, and comfortable with ambiguity and shifting priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You move fast and can manage yourself to a high standard.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;What’s ahead in Australia?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow with us globally -&lt;/strong&gt; Get mentorship from leaders across Australia, the UK, Germany, and Japan, collaborate with teams in the Philippines and South Africa, and explore new markets or travel internationally. Recognised on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hatch.team/companies/eucalyptus&quot;&gt;Hatch’s Hotlist&lt;/a&gt; as one of Australia’s top employers, we support early-career professionals to become future global leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Shape your career -&lt;/strong&gt; Access learning budgets, conferences, certifications, peer shadowing, and a global knowledge-sharing culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work where well-being matters -&lt;/strong&gt; Experience catered wellness talks, exercise classes, free barista coffees, funded social clubs, and quarterly rooftop parties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Innovate with purpose -&lt;/strong&gt; Use state-of-the-art tools and contribute to bold, impactful solutions in healthcare.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Support at every stage -&lt;/strong&gt; Benefit from parental and miscarriage leave, health, professional development, and personal days, and our Employee Assistance Program.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work more efficiently, including within our recruitment process. These tools support our team — all hiring decisions are made by real people, and every application is reviewed by a member of our recruitment team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;About Eucalyptus&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re on a mission to make good health last a lifetime. More than 1 billion people live with obesity worldwide, driving preventable chronic conditions. We&#39;re here to build better long-term care.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Eucalyptus is now part of Hims &amp;amp; Hers, the global leader in personalised health and wellness.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Euc is the company behind Juniper, one of the world&#39;s largest weight-management programs combining GLP-1 medication with personalised nutrition, movement support, and clinician-led care from prescribers, nurses, health coaches, pharmacists, and dietitians. Our published clinical research shows that our combined clinical and behavioural approach helps patients lose significantly more weight during their treatment with Juniper by four times.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Our Growth Story:&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supporting patients living with obesity across our 5 markets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Received selective NICE endorsement to provide services to the NHS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tailored our offering to thousands of patients in Australia, the UK, Germany, Japan and Canada.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Services team is at the heart of how Juniper delivers outcomes for patients. We run one of the world&#39;s fastest-scaling health coaching operations — directly responsible for the engagement, retention, and weight loss outcomes of our patient base — and we&#39;re looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Strategy &amp;amp; Operations Associate&lt;/strong&gt; to cover a maternity leave on a &lt;strong&gt;1-year fixed-term contract&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a project-heavy, cross-functional role with a lot of variety. You&#39;ll work on pressing operational and strategic challenges in the Services function, translating strategy into execution and reporting to the Head of Services. In practice, that means designing and improving the systems, processes, and ways of working that allow us to deliver a great coaching experience at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role does not include direct people management, but you&#39;ll work closely with Health Coaching Team Leads and other cross-functional stakeholders (products/ operations/ clinical team) to drive projects from hypothesis to completion.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No two weeks will look the same. If you&#39;re someone who gets stuck in, enjoys problem solving, thrives in ambiguity and wants to do work that improves how we deliver care at scale and affects patient outcomes — this role is for you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll own a mix of projects and ongoing operational work (typically 2-3+ things at a time) that improve patient outcomes and drive meaningful business value for Eucalyptus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll be accountable for moving core team metrics like engagement with our services, retention, quality of support, and safe practicing within the Health Coaching team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive operational excellence in how we deliver coaching at scale&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and optimise the systems and processes coaching teams use day-to-day, to improve efficiency and scalability and ensure we can deliver a consistent, high-quality service as we continue to grow&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to effective capacity planning, coverage, and resource allocation across the team to meet demand and maintain quality standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Spot inefficiencies and fix them — whether that&#39;s a broken process, a gap in our tooling, or something that worked at a smaller scale but doesn&#39;t anymore&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate patient and commercial problems into clear hypotheses, measurable success metrics, and execution plans that ship improvements fast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data and operational insights to inform future service design, ensuring the function scales effectively with business growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead cross-functional initiatives end-to-end&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a primary point of contact for mid-level and senior stakeholders, translating strategic priorities into clear execution plans across the HC team, taking priorities and turning them into clear plans the team can actually deliver&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with product, clinical, and operations teams to improve how coaching fits into the broader patient experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own projects end-to-end: define what needs to happen, keep things on track, remove blockers, and see them through to completion - holding a high bar for pace and quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a strategic thought partner to Services leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and improve key performance metrics (engagement, retention, quality, safety), intervening where needed to drive results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data to make the case for what we should prioritise, and to inform decisions about how the team is structured and resourced&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Feed into planning cycles with practical insights grounded in internal team context relevant to your work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;3+ years in operations, strategy, or a similar generalist role&lt;/strong&gt; — ideally at a fast-growing company&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Confident with data&lt;/strong&gt; — proficient in Google Sheets and able to draw practical conclusions from numbers to inform decisions and plans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hands-on operational experience&lt;/strong&gt; — you&#39;ve improved processes, managed systems, and run projects from start to finish&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong communicator&lt;/strong&gt; — comfortable working with senior stakeholders, translating goals into clear plans, and keeping people aligned as things change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A creative, positive problem-solver&lt;/strong&gt; — you take initiative, find solutions, and stay constructive and flexible when things get complicated&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strong collaborator&lt;/strong&gt; — you care more about getting things done than getting credit, and you&#39;re happy to do the unglamorous work when it&#39;s needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercially aware&lt;/strong&gt; — you understand how the business makes money and can connect your work to what actually matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Bonus points&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with health coaching, nutrition, or patient-facing services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in digital health or a health-adjacent industry&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background at a startup or scale-up&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;People management experience (not a requirement, but useful — some project management elements form part of the role)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Is Exciting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work on things that matter.&lt;/strong&gt; The Services team is directly responsible for patient outcomes — your work will have a real impact on the health and wellbeing of thousands of people.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own work end-to-end.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll drive operational and strategic projects from problem definition through to delivery, with accountability for the outcome.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Grow quickly.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll get a lot of variety, real ownership, and the chance to work across strategy, operations, and delivery in a fast-moving environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work with great people.&lt;/strong&gt; You&#39;ll be part of a high-performance team that cares deeply about patients and holds a high bar for quality.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;So, Why Join Eucalyptus?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make real impact, fast&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- We build in the open together, which helps us learn and iterate more quickly so we can deliver high quality outcomes faster than anyone else. Helping impact patients lives for the better from the moment you join Euc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll work with others who are incredibly passionate about what they do&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;- Our talent bar is high and our work ethic is strong. You’ll get to stretch yourself everyday, be given autonomy to tackle interesting problems, and work amongst people who care deeply about our patients.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Want to hear more about what it’s like to work at Eucalyptus? Hear from our team&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://eucalyptus.vc/careers&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; or check us out on Instagram @eucalyptus.health&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Eucalyptus, we value individuals from all backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives, and we embrace the unique qualities each person brings. When you apply, please let us know of any reasonable adjustments you may need during the interview process. We use AI-assisted tools across our business to help our teams work more efficiently, including within our recruitment process. These tools support our team — all hiring decisions are made by real people, and every application is reviewed by a member of our recruitment team.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

