&lt;li&gt;Metabolic health and hormonal health conditions and are future areas of interest for the business. You will work on new ideas which we may want to validate in future, and shape those ideas with clinical input and context — acting as a thinking partner to the product and commercial teams as we explore what comes next.&lt;/li&gt;
